              </label>
              <div id="upload-diploma" class="mt-2 ml-4 pl-4 border-l-2 border-purple-200 dark:border-purple-900 space-y-1.5" style="display:none">
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400"><i class="bi bi-cloud-arrow-up mr-1"></i><%= currentLang === 'km' ? 'បង្ហោះព្រឹត្តិបត្រពិន្ទុ / សំណុំបែបបទ' : 'Upload score report / transcript' %></p>
                <input type="file" name="transcript" accept=".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png" class="w-full text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 file:mr-4 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:rounded-xl file:border-0 file:text-sm file:font-semibold file:bg-purple-50 file:text-purple-700 dark:file:bg-purple-900/30 dark:file:text-purple-300 hover:file:bg-purple-100 dark:hover:file:bg-purple-900/50">
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">PDF, JPG, PNG • Max 5MB</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="doc-row flex items-start gap-3 p-3 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 cursor-pointer transition-all">
                <input type="checkbox" name="documents_ready" value="birth_cert" data-upload="upload-birth-cert" class="mt-0.5 text-green-600 focus:ring-green-500 rounded">
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200"><%= currentLang === 'km' ? 'សំបុត្រកំណើត ឬ សំបុត្របញ្ជាក់កំណើត ឬ ឯកសារឯកត្តជន ចំនួន ០២ ច្បាប់' : 'Birth certificate or certificate of birth or personal documents (2 copies)' %></span>
              </label>
              <div id="upload-birth-cert" class="mt-2 ml-4 pl-4 border-l-2 border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-900 space-y-1.5" style="display:none">
                <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400"><i class="bi bi-cloud-arrow-up mr-1"></i><%= currentLang === 'km' ? 'បង្ហោះសំបុត្រកំណើត / ឯកសារឯកត្តជន' : 'Upload birth certificate / personal documents' %></p>
                <input type="file" name="additionalDocuments" multiple accept=".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png" class="w-full text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 file:mr-4 file:py-2 file:px-4 file:rounded-xl file:border-0 file:text-sm file:font-semibold file:bg-blue-50 file:text-blue-700 dark:file:bg-blue-900/30 dark:file:text-blue-300 hover:file:bg-blue-100 dark:hover:file:bg-blue-900/50">
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">PDF, JPG, PNG • Max 5MB</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <label class="doc-row flex items-start gap-3 p-3 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700/50 cursor-pointer transition-all">
                <input type="checkbox" name="documents_ready" value="photo_4x6" data-upload="upload-photo-4x6" class="mt-0.5 text-green-600 focus:ring-green-500 rounded">
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200"><%= currentLang === 'km' ? 'រូបថតទំហំ 4 × 6 ថតចំពីមុខ ឥតពាក់វ៉ែនតា ចំនួន ០២ សន្លឹក' : '4 × 6 photo, taken from the front, without glasses (2 sheets)' %></span>
